  "summary_en": "European Commission Communication setting out an EU strategy to integrate civil remotely piloted aircraft systems (drones) into European airspace from 2016. It proposes harmonised, risk-proportionate EASA rules, R&D, security, privacy and data protection measures, liability and insurance review, and industrial support.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Integrate RPAS into civil airspace from 2016 with safety equivalent to manned aviation",
   "EASA to develop risk-proportionate common rules; reconsider the 150 kg competence threshold",
   "Address security, privacy and data protection of RPAS operations",
   "Assess third-party liability and insurance rules for RPAS below 500 kg",
   "Use Horizon 2020 and COSME to support the RPAS industry and SMEs"
